    (6, None, '\'Nothing terrible, Max, I understand.\' "Nichego strashnogo" again, the third time in this episode: Russians say it all the time. "Ponimayu" is "I understand". Louis forgives him quickly and warmly.'),
    (7, None, '\'Cooking such desserts is really difficult.\' Russian says "gotovit takie deserty, eto realno slozhno", with "eto", "this", as a hinge. "Realno", "really", is a slangy word built from "real".'),
    (8, None, '\'Many think that these are simple sweets.\' "Sladosti", "sweets", grows from "sladky", "sweet". "Mnogie" is "many people". Louis has heard this opinion too many times.'),
